(BAS-19 - a function definition is closed by a blank line, and that is
 what makes the statements after it top-level. With the blank line in
 place the call runs and `Print "top"` runs after it.
 Also covers: BAS-22's first half is a separate probe; the contrast case
 (no blank line) is BAS-21.
